{"tool_name":"cytomegalovirusdb","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"cytomegalovirusdb","home":"http://www.cmvdb.dqweilab-sjtu.com/index.php","summary":"Multi-omics knowledge database for cytomegaloviruses.","addition_date":"2021-11-24T15:12:16.115079Z","last_update_date":"2021-11-24T15:12:16.117666Z","tool_type":["Database portal"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:cytomegalovirusdb","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"dqwei@sjtu.edu.cn","name":"Dong-Qing Wei"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"public"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"siRNA binding specificity prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0465"},{"term":"siRNA duplex prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2008"}]}],"name":"CytomegaloVirusDb","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Chan019","publication":[{"doi":"10.1016/J.COMPBIOMED.2021.104563","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2021 Elsevier LtdCytomegalovirus infection is a significant health concern and need further exploration in immunologic response mechanisms during primary and reactivated CMV infection. In this work, we evaluated the whole genomes and proteomes of different CMV species and developed an integrated open-access platform, CytomegaloVirusDb, a multi-Omics knowledge database for Cytomegaloviruses. The resource is categorized into the main sections \u201cGenomics,\u201d \u201cProteomics,\u201d \u201cImmune response,\u201d and \u201cTherapeutics,\u201c. The database is annotated with the list of all CMV species included in the study, and available information is freely accessible at http://www.cmvdb.dqweilab-sjtu.com/index.php. Various parameters used in the analysis for each section were primarily based on the whole genome or proteome of each specie. The platform provided datasets are open to access for researchers to obtain CMV species-specific information. This will help further to explore the dynamics of CMV-specific immune response and therapeutics. This platform is a useful resource to aid in advancing research against Cytomegaloviruses.","authors":[{"name":"Ahmad S."},{"name":"Ali S.S."},{"name":"Khan A."},{"name":"Khan T."},{"name":"Nasir S.N."},{"name":"Wei D.-Q."}],"date":"2021-08-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Computers in Biology and Medicine","title":"CytomegaloVirusDb: Multi-omics knowledge database for cytomegaloviruses"},"pmid":"34256256"}],"topic":[{"term":"Allergy, clinical immunology and immunotherapeutics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3400"},{"term":"Functional, regulatory and non-coding RNA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0659"},{"term":"Immunology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0804"},{"term":"Proteomics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121"},{"term":"Sequence analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0080"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"CytomegaloVirusDb","home":"https://bio.tools/cytomegalovirusdb","summary":"Multi-omics knowledge database for cytomegaloviruses.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:cytomegalovirusdb/db/www.cmvdb.dqweilab-sjtu.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":12,"citations":[{"count":2,"year":"2021"},{"count":2,"year":"2023"},{"count":2,"year":"2025"},{"count":3,"year":"2022"},{"count":3,"year":"2024"}],"doi":"10.1016/j.compbiomed.2021.104563","pmid":"34256256","ref_count":0,"refs":[],"title":"CytomegaloVirusDb: Multi-omics knowledge database for cytomegaloviruses.","year":2021}]}],"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":false,"copyright":false,"https":false,"license":false,"operational":408,"redirects":[{"status":301,"url":"https://www.cmvdb.dqweilab-sjtu.com/index.php"}],"ssl":null,"ssl_err":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/cytomegaloviru